 have had a long lasting regular  gig or home improvement if he wanted it  Topol offski originally won the role of  our Borland Tim Taylor's long-suffering  extra competent tool time assistant he  walked away however when they couldn't  assure him of a proper start date and  still wanted an exclusive contract toby  Loski told split cider  i couldn't do any other work any other  shows which is normal on a regular show  but my wife was pregnant we had a  becoming I had auditions for a couple of  movies and was waiting on them and they  said I couldn't do movies rather than  risk of being broke for months Tobel of  ski parted ways of home improvements and  the part of being the butt of every joke  went to Richard Karn instead Ashley Judd  needs no improvement Pamela Anderson's  high profile career really started when  she played Lisa the tool girl on tool  time  the show-within-a-show on home  improvement but award-winning star and  activist Ashley Judd also tried out for  the part when she auditioned for the  show creator Matt Williams thought she  was so talented even too talented for  the somewhat thankless iCandy role of  Lisa Williams called Judds agent and  said that while she didn't get the part  he was going to create a role just for  her as Tim Taylor's sister but that  alpha was declined and she went on to  star in NBC's drama sisters instead  Chappelle's first show home improvement  might not seem like the kind of vehicle  to propel the career of one of the most  incendiary comedians of all time but it  did on a 1995 episode of home  improvement Tim Taylor's tool time  descended as it often did into a  discussion about her marriage can be  tough Tim asked if anyone in the studio  audience had liked him been tricked into  a fight with their significant other two  guys named Dave and Jim could relate and  Tim pulled them up on stage what were  you thinking I was thinking of calling  you yes I what no you were as Dave  Chappelle lit up the screen impressing  AB